+(a full 100k-cell fit runs in ~10 min on one A100; see
+[`docs/gpu_speed_and_scale.md`](docs/gpu_speed_and_scale.md)).
+`use_unified=True` also works with `use_gpu=False` (an optimized, single-source CPU path).
+
